322ba91b3731","layer":"original","quote":"及先主定蜀，微常称聋，闭门不出","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":36,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-f2272436b7af58e82d78","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-54784f7ae51ee855c557","layer":"original","quote":"建兴二年，丞相亮领益州牧，选迎皆妙简旧德〖2〗：以秦宓为别驾，五梁为功曹，微为主簿","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-f3adcda7d66d489843cf","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-42fdaa05322ba91b3731","layer":"original","quote":"刘璋辟为从事，以疾去官","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":24,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q2-7e5f7551749d5933a4ef","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-d34749af9587529c3386","layer":"original","quote":"微自乞老病求归，亮又与书答曰：“曹丕篡弑，自立为帝，是犹土龙、刍狗之有名也〖17〗。欲与群贤因其邪伪，以正道灭之；怪君未有相诲，便欲求还于山野。丕又大兴劳役〖18〗，以向吴、楚〖19〗。今因丕多务，且以闭境（勤）〔劝〕农，育养民物〖20〗，并治甲兵，以待其挫；然后伐之，可使兵不战民不劳而天下定也。君但当以德辅时耳〖21〗，不责君军事〖22〗；何为汲汲欲求去乎〖23〗？”其敬微如此。","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":192,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q2-96c943816412990f2932","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-42fdaa05322ba91b3731","layer":"original","quote":"杜微字国辅，梓潼涪人也。少受学于广汉任安〖1〗。刘璋辟为从事，以疾去官。及先主定蜀，微常称聋，闭门不出。","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":52,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q2-bac62845d1701ddb0f29","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-82cc058661f427bc9efa","layer":"original","quote":"既至，亮引见微，微自陈谢。亮以微不闻人语，于坐上与书曰：“服闻德行，饥渴历时〖4〗；清浊异流〖5〗，无缘咨觏〖6〗。王元泰、李伯仁、王文仪、杨季休、丁君幹、李永南兄弟、文仲宝等〖7〗，每叹高志，未见如旧〖8〗！猥以空虚〖9〗，统领贵州；德薄任重，惨惨忧虑〖10〗。朝廷（主公）今年始十八〖11〗；天姿仁敏，爱德下士。天下之人思慕汉室，欲与君因天顺民，辅此明主；以隆季兴之功〖12〗，著勋于竹帛也。以谓贤愚不相为谋〖13〗，故自割绝〖14〗，守劳而已〖15〗；不图自屈也〖16〗！”","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":240,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-403b0d6717c6c241dced","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-eeece5f7b734fad61b54","layer":"original","quote":"叛乱之后，忠抚育恤理，甚有威惠","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":127,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":47,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{"duzhou-p0038":{"fields":[],"directory":{"faction":"shu"}}},"directory_counts":{}}
